  "description": [
    "Well-manicured lawns dotted with majestic weeping willows and lush rose bushes are demarcated by trimmed hedges.  A tall hawthorne hedge, broken only by an ivy-lined marble walkway, separates the lawn from the grounds beyond.  A stately manor caps one end of the lawn, the exterior of dark granite and ash-veined black marble polished to a gleaming luster."
